{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12242120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12242120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1224212001:0":{"text":"What's up?","source_cn":"有事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x28C91F9537CD89CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's up?","female":"What's up?","variant_male_record_index":"140787","variant_female_record_index":"140788","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1224212001":{"text":"What's up?","source_cn":"有事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x28C91F9537CD89CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's up?","female":"What's up?","variant_male_record_index":"140787","variant_female_record_index":"140788","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224212002:1":{"text":"Yes. Is there a problem?","source_cn":"是。不行吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8368F6DDD29BE198","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes. Is there a problem?","female":"Yes. Is there a problem?","variant_male_record_index":"140789","variant_female_record_index":"140790","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224212005:1":{"text":"Why were you so upset? Was it because of the two dockworkers? What they said didn't sound too offensive to me though...","source_cn":"为什么这么生气呀？难道是因为那两个码头工人说的话？可是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD3C9AA1B8FA17AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224212006:1":{"text":"...I joined the Carmine Whispers because of the port blockade.","source_cn":"……我就是因为港口被封锁才加入血薇帮的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB12F432398CF5918","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224212007:1":{"text":"Huh? I'm surprised some people find that policy appealing.","source_cn":"咦，什么意思？封锁政策还能招揽成员？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478268BC33B79E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1224212007":{"text":"Huh? I'm surprised some people find that policy appealing.","source_cn":"咦，什么意思？封锁政策还能招揽成员？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478268BC33B79E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224212008:1":{"text":"That's right.","source_cn":"没错。<key:dialog4>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x56AEAEFDFF178DCE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's right.","female":"That's right.","variant_male_record_index":"140798","variant_female_record_index":"140799","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224212010:0":{"text":"Sailing... itself is dangerous, especially with the Dead Tide Fleet rampant at sea back then.","source_cn":"航海……本身就很危险了。更何况当时还有死潮舰队在海上作乱。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3566A5AEFB0C8454","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sailing... itself is dangerous, especially with the Dead Tide Fleet rampant at sea back then.","female":"Sailing... itself is dangerous, especially with the Dead Tide Fleet rampant at sea back then.","variant_male_record_index":"140802","variant_female_record_index":"140803","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224212011:1":{"text":"Sonja and Lucca were right about implementing the blockade—that was the only way to keep everyone safe.","source_cn":"老大和二当家是对的。只有封锁锈锚港，才能保护这里的人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA744F87696282D8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sonja and Lucca were right about implementing the blockade—that was the only way to keep everyone safe.","female":"Sonja and Lucca were right about implementing the blockade—that was the only way to keep everyone safe.","variant_male_record_index":"140804","variant_female_record_index":"140805","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224212012:1":{"text":"As for now... hmm.","source_cn":"至于现在……呵。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x89DD3CDF9A035452","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"As for now... hmm.","female":"As for now... hmm.","variant_male_record_index":"140806","variant_female_record_index":"140807","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224212013:1":{"text":"Well, I've got to update <style=\"highlight\">Lucca</style> about the situation at the docks. You should come along.","source_cn":"好了，没空闲聊了。我得回去向<style=highli...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D2A72BC9E0431F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, I've got to update <style=\"highlight\">Lucca</style> about the situation at the docks. You should come along.","female":"Well, I've got to update <style=\"highlight\">Lucca</style> about the situ